From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 14:48:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] remote pairing: allow caller Bonjour advertising and an early
 setup PIN

Mobile hosts must publish through platform Bonjour and show a PIN before the user leaves the foreground. Add a blocking cancellable FFI with borrowed advertising and credential callbacks; keep existing APIs unchanged.

Class: host-app
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-30-on-device-pairing.md (iOS 27.0 24A437: same-phone pairing, readiness, Hollow Knight first-frame+10)
Offered-upstream: no; to be offered to jkcoxson/idevice
---
